<title>FRANCE: Alcatel wins Panama power plant order.</title>
<headline>Alcatel wins Panama power plant order.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said that Equitable Resources Inc. had awarded a 165 million franc contract to Alcatel's Cegelec for the turn-key construction of a diesel fossil-fired power plant in Panama.</p>
<p>The 50 MegaWatt plant will be located on the Atlantic coast near the town of Colon.</p>
</text>
